<template><div>
<header class="topbar"><div class="crumb">学习分析 / <b>错题本</b></div><div class="search">⌕ <span>搜索题目、答案…</span></div><div class="top-actions"><button class="btn ghost" @click="load">刷新</button><router-link class="btn" to="/admin/questions">去题库</router-link><div class="avatar">AS</div></div></header>
<div class="content"><div class="page-title"><div><h1>错题本</h1><p>按题目汇总错误次数与错误率，找到真正需要复习的内容。</p></div></div>
<div class="quick-stats" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);margin-bottom:16px"><div class="panel" style="padding:15px"><span class="muted" style="font-size:12px">易错题目</span><div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700">{{items.length}}</div></div><div class="panel" style="padding:15px"><span class="muted" style="font-size:12px">累计错误</span><div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700">{{totalWrong}}</div></div><div class="panel" style="padding:15px"><span class="muted" style="font-size:12px">累计作答</span><div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700">{{totalAttempts}}</div></div><div class="panel" style="padding:15px"><span class="muted" style="font-size:12px">平均错误率</span><div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700">{{avgRate}}</div></div></div>
<div class="panel" style="overflow:hidden"><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:78px minmax(0,1fr) 90px 80px 90px 150px;gap:10px;padding:11px 16px;background:#f8fafd;color:#7f8da0;font-size:11px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)"><span>图片</span><span>题目</span><span>错误次数</span><span>总次数</span><span>错误率</span><span>最近错误</span></div><div v-for="q in items" :key="q.question_id" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:78px minmax(0,1fr) 90px 80px 90px 150px;gap:10px;padding:11px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f4f9;align-items:center"><img v-if="q.imageUrl" :src="q.imageUrl" style="width:70px;height:54px;object-fit:contain;border:1px solid #edf2f8;border-radius:8px;background:#fff"><span v-else class="faint">无图</span><div><b style="font-size:13px">{{q.answer}}</b><div class="faint" style="font-size:11px">{{q.typeLabel}} · {{q.ageGroup?.name}} · {{q.subject?.name}}</div></div><b>{{q.wrong_attempts}}</b><span>{{q.total_attempts}}</span><span>{{Math.round((q.wrongRate||0)*100)}}%</span><span class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{q.last_wrong_at}}<br><a class="link" @click="preview(q)">查看题目</a></span></div><div v-if="!items.length" class="empty"><b>还没有错题</b>等电视端产生错误作答后显示。</div></div></div>
<div v-if="active" class="drawer-backdrop" @click.self="active=null"></div><aside v-if="active" class="drawer"><div class="drawer-head"><h2>错题详情</h2><button class="close" @click="active=null">×</button></div><div class="drawer-body"><div class="preview-img"><img v-if="active.imageUrl" :src="active.imageUrl"></div><div class="answer-card"><span>答案</span><b>{{active.answer}}</b></div><div class="meta"><div class="meta-item"><span>错误率</span>{{Math.round((active.wrongRate||0)*100)}}%</div><div class="meta-item"><span>错误 / 总数</span>{{active.wrong_attempts}} / {{active.total_attempts}}</div></div></div></aside>
<div v-if="toast" :key="toast" class="toast">{{toast}}</div></div>
</template>
<script setup>import{ref,computed,onMounted}from'vue';import{api}from'../api';const items=ref([]),active=ref(null),toast=ref('');const totalWrong=computed(()=>items.value.reduce((n,q)=>n+(q.wrong_attempts||0),0));const totalAttempts=computed(()=>items.value.reduce((n,q)=>n+(q.total_attempts||0),0));const avgRate=computed(()=>totalAttempts.value?Math.round(totalWrong.value/totalAttempts.value*100)+'%':'0%');async function load(){try{const d=await api('/api/v1/admin/wrong-questions?limit=200');items.value=d.items||[]}catch(e){toast.value=e.message}}function preview(q){active.value=q}onMounted(load)</script>
